Install from local directory
From NPM:
npm install

Execution
From Terminal:
cd merkle-tree-verify
node ./verify.js <merkle tree data directory> <merkle leaf hash>

Example:
cd merkle-tree-verify
node ./verify.js ./output_merkle_tree_small.txt 64b3993941c4989c

Contributor
Thanks to all merkletreejs[https://github.com/merkletreejs/merkletreejs] and all its contributor.
